# Top-level Python packages for the local Google Fonts build, report, and
# package-review workflow. Keep this list small; requirements.txt is the
# pinned install snapshot generated from the active local .venv.
# Proofs and specimen images use DesignBot (installed separately).
# fontspectorapi runs the Font.Garden profile in
# scripts/fontspector_fontgarden.py. fontgarden-tools is the shared source
# tooling of Font.Garden projects, pinned to a commit.
fontmake
fonttools
gftools
diffenator3
ufo2ft
gflanguages
gfsubsets
axisregistry
opentype-sanitizer
GitPython
glyphsets
PyYAML
uharfbuzz
fontgarden-tools @ git+https://github.com/fontgarden/fontgarden-tools@446ec1bf55bee8d0b297a6b7cb9ed64c2b3005cc
fontspectorapi
